<title>UK: Allianz unit sets 1.5 bln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Allianz unit sets 1.5 bln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLIANZ INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ALLIANZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  2.175     LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
